---
// DistroTabs.astro
---

<div class="tabs-container">
  <div class="tabs-nav" role="tablist">
    <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="arch" role="tab" aria-selected="true">
      <span class="tab-icon">⚡</span>
      <span class="tab-title">Arch Linux / Manjaro</span>
      <span class="tab-tag">Pacman</span>
    </button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="debian" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
      <span class="tab-icon">🌀</span>
      <span class="tab-title">Debian / Ubuntu / Mint</span>
      <span class="tab-tag">APT</span>
    </button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="appimage" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
      <span class="tab-icon">📦</span>
      <span class="tab-title">Universal Linux</span>
      <span class="tab-tag">AppImage</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="tabs-content">
    <!-- ARCH PANEL -->
    <div id="tab-arch" class="tab-pane active" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="pane-header">
        <h3>Instalação via Repositório Pacman (x86_64)</h3>
        <p>Receba atualizações automáticas do Play Max via <code>pacman -Syu</code>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">1</span>
        <div class="step-info">
          <h4>Instalação Automática em 1 Linha (Recomendado)</h4>
          <p>Adiciona o repositório oficial ao <code>/etc/pacman.conf</code> e instala o aplicativo:</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>echo -e "\n[playmax]\nSigLevel = Optional TrustAll\nServer = https://repo.rictv.top/\$arch" | sudo tee -a /etc/pacman.conf && sudo pacman -Sy rp-play-max-linux</code></pre>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-code="echo -e &quot;\n[playmax]\nSigLevel = Optional TrustAll\nServer = https://repo.rictv.top/\$arch&quot; | sudo tee -a /etc/pacman.conf &amp;&amp; sudo pacman -Sy rp-play-max-linux">
          <svg class="copy-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
          <span class="copy-label">Copiar</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">2</span>
        <div class="step-info">
          <h4>Ou Atualização Manual</h4>
          <p>Se o repositório já estiver configurado, basta sincronizar e atualizar:</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>sudo pacman -Syu rp-play-max-linux</code></pre>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-code="sudo pacman -Syu rp-play-max-linux">
          <svg class="copy-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
          <span class="copy-label">Copiar</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DEBIAN PANEL -->
    <div id="tab-debian" class="tab-pane" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="pane-header">
        <h3>Instalação para Distribuições baseadas em Debian / Ubuntu</h3>
        <p>Instale o pacote binário <code>.deb</code> oficial diretamente no seu sistema.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">1</span>
        <div class="step-info">
          <h4>Baixe o pacote <code>.deb</code> oficial</h4>
          <p>Utilize o terminal para baixar a versão mais recente:</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>wget https://repo.rictv.top/rp-play-max-linux_2.2.4_amd64.deb</code></pre>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-code="wget https://repo.rictv.top/rp-play-max-linux_2.2.4_amd64.deb">
          <svg class="copy-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
          <span class="copy-label">Copiar</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">2</span>
        <div class="step-info">
          <h4>Instale via APT / dpkg</h4>
          <p>Resolva as dependências e registre no menu de aplicativos:</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>sudo apt install ./rp-play-max-linux_2.2.4_amd64.deb</code></pre>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-code="sudo apt install ./rp-play-max-linux_2.2.4_amd64.deb">
          <svg class="copy-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
          <span class="copy-label">Copiar</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- APPIMAGE PANEL -->
    <div id="tab-appimage" class="tab-pane" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="pane-header">
        <h3>Execução Universal via AppImage</h3>
        <p>Compatível com qualquer distribuição Linux de 64 bits sem necessidade de instalação root.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <span class="step-num">1</span>
        <div class="step-info">
          <h4>Baixe e conceda permissão de execução</h4>
          <p>Execute os comandos para baixar e rodar instantaneamente:</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>wget -O "RP - Play Max.AppImage" "https://repo.rictv.top/RP%20-%20Play%20Max-2.2.4.AppImage"
chmod +x "RP - Play Max.AppImage"
./"RP - Play Max.AppImage"</code></pre>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-code="wget -O &quot;RP - Play Max.AppImage&quot; &quot;https://repo.rictv.top/RP%20-%20Play%20Max-2.2.4.AppImage&quot;&#10;chmod +x &quot;RP - Play Max.AppImage&quot;&#10;./&quot;RP - Play Max.AppImage&quot;">
          <svg class="copy-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
          <span class="copy-label">Copiar</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  // Tab Switcher Logic
  const tabBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');
  const tabPanes = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-pane');

  tabBtns.forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const targetTab = btn.getAttribute('data-tab');
      
      tabBtns.forEach(b => {
        b.classList.remove('active');
        b.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
      });
      tabPanes.forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));

      btn.classList.add('active');
      btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
      const activePane = document.getElementById(`tab-${targetTab}`);
      if (activePane) activePane.classList.add('active');
    });
  });

  // Copy to Clipboard Logic
  const copyBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.copy-btn');
  copyBtns.forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const code = btn.getAttribute('data-code');
      const label = btn.querySelector('.copy-label');
      if (!code) return;

      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code);
        if (label) label.textContent = 'Copiado!';
        btn.classList.add('copied');
        setTimeout(() => {
          if (label) label.textContent = 'Copiar';
          btn.classList.remove('copied');
        }, 2000);
      } catch (err) {
        console.error('Falha ao copiar:', err);
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .tabs-container {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .tabs-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .tab-btn {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tab-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
    border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
  }

  .tab-tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .tab-btn.active .tab-tag {
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
    color: #e9d5ff;
  }

  .tab-pane {
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tab-pane.active {
    display: flex;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .pane-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .pane-header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .step-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-gradient);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-info h4 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .step-info p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .code-block {
    background: var(--code-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .code-block pre {
    margin: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #38bdf8;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .copy-btn {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .copy-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .copy-btn.copied {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);
    color: #34d399;
  }

  .copy-icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }
</style>
